Outbooked
Outbooked is a structured, responsive event management system built using Razor Pages and Bootstrap. It supports full CRUD operations, conflict detection logic, mock syncing for Outlook, and unit testing — all powered by a shared in-memory data store.

Features
- Create, edit, delete, and view events
- Built-in conflict detection via TripleSeatService
- Mock syncing via OutlookSyncService with future Graph API integration
- Responsive dashboard with status badges and toast confirmations
- Dashboard filtering by status (Confirmed, Pending, Cancelled)
- Unit tests using xUnit in Outbooked.Tests

Tech Stack
| Layer | Tools and Frameworks | 
| Backend | C#, Razor Pages (.NET 8), Dependency Injection | 
| Services | EventRepository, TripleSeatService, OutlookSyncService | 
| Testing | xUnit with mock integration | 
| UI / UX | Bootstrap 5, Razor Pages | 
| Environment | Visual Studio, .NET SDK | 



Setup Instructions
- Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/OutbookedApp
- Open in Visual Studio and build the solution
- Navigate to /Events — all functionality runs through Razor Pages
- Sample event data is preloaded via EventRepository for testing

